          "en": "1. This Law shall take effect from 1 January 2022, except for the case provided in clause 2 of this Article.\n2. Clause 3 of Article 29 of this Law shall take effect from 1 February 2021.\n3. The Law on Environmental Protection No. 55/2014/QH13, which was amended and supplemented in a number of articles by Law No. 35/2018/QH14, Law No. 39/2019/QH14 and Law No. 61/2020/QH14, shall cease to have effect from the date this Law takes effect."
